			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Enforce type-only exports for Effect service interfaces\n\nThis commit updates the barrel file `Source/Effect/index.ts` to strictly re-export service interfaces and associated types using the `export type` syntax.\n\nIn the Effect-TS architecture utilized by Wind, it is critical to distinguish between the structural definition of a service (the interface) and its runtime implementation (the tag). By migrating exports like `IPCService` and `MountainService` to `export type`, we prevent accidental runtime usage of these interfaces and ensure cleaner type-only imports for consumers within the Wind service layer and Sky UI components.\n\nThis refactoring standardizes the export pattern across all core services: IPC, Sandbox, Configuration, Telemetry, and Mountain.",
